          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            In
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/philosophy"} philosophy
            %em universe
            is a realm within which (some conceived part, naively and virtually all, of) reality takes place.
          %p
            In
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            %em universe
            is a realm within which
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/physics"} physics
            may be thought of as taking place. Such universes include:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                all of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
                and its contents,
            %li
              %p
                the
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/observable+universe"} observable universe
          %p
            In
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mathematics"} mathematics
            %em universe
            is a realm within which
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/mathematics"} mathematics
            may be thought of as taking place. Such universes include:
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                In
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/set+theory"} set theory
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/universe+of+sets"} universe of sets
                such as a
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/von+Neumann+universe"} von Neumann universe
                or a
                = succeed ";" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Grothendieck+universe"} Grothendieck universe
            %li
